Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars and reach for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, baby, oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.42,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll\Ntry. No matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.06,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, let's go. Maybe, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, this guy's unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He can shoot those beams\Nfrom his hands and his mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How's he shooting us with anyway\Nbeings obviously that would be pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick-ass if it were true that tech doesn't\Neven exist. It's just fantasy, way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing dead. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Style all right. Now come,\Ncome about some Diable
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They took him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three are just too awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget he's one of the warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a lot more\Nthan that to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And judging by their\Nfaces, they know that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's different now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then maybe he's a twin or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.24,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible, but that's a scary thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They look the same, but they're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The real one when they\Nteleported to dodge our attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.04,0:04:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't use that shockwave attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have those paws either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's plenty strong as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse, the real\None might be after us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,well done you gave me quite a beating but\NI'm not just bigger now I'm much Stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,too, than Trabucin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The mad monk, Rouge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,may have escaped death countless\Ntimes before reaching this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how strong he\Ngrows, he cannot escape his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:06:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Kizuru's laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So he recreated Kizuru's attacks\Nwhile using Bartholomew Kuma's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the pacifista\Ntechnology had advanced so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one hell of a show!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to admit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But a warlord and an admiral friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even three pirates with bounties\Nover a hundred million can handle that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that rear admiral Drake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, former rear admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here for your old job back, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you'd like\Nto test the pacifista?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your inside knowledge will\Nonly make your despair all the greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I suggest you, little chickies,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,exercise the level of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you have me\Nto contend with, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, this fight just delivers\None crazy thing after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare ancient Zolan type!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You bleed red blood just\Nlike the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A truly rare sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As I was just saying, you\Nhave to contend with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Now ain't that something? You\Nsupernovas are a strange bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of you turns\Ninto some scary monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon face
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes Captain Hawkins,\Nrun, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your power is, but\NI do know you have a physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like you're a Logia-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any more\Nvoodoo dials to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't take any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're the first to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well to journey all this way,\Nand for that, you have my compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,yo, yo, yo, yeah, yo, is\Nthis music reaching you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hear it, stay\Ntuned, Navy Admiral Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's the one, he's the sea roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the Dial, fighting\Nmusic, kicking it live.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Though knowing you navy admirals you'll\Nprobably be right back up in a second
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I hung around for a\Nbit this was a sight to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,see I guess it's time\Nfor me to scram Peace out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the Yata mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ah, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Barcelona.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what the heck, Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You do have a baby transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you contact me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that you sent to Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that is that you business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried contacting you before,\Nbut I couldn't get a hold of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you were trying to talk\Ninto the black transponder snail again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you before, the black one on\Nyour wrist is for eavesdropping, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, it's fine. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time we get to work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the culprits have split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, Captain\NEustass Kidd, and Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one do we start with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you already hurt so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just forget about\Nhim for now, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all screwed if we\Ncan't beat this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:14:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't had the chance to recover\Nfrom last time standing up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,him at all must be pretty damn\Npainful that look on his face tells me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,everything i need to know this\Nbastard wants us dead but if he's not
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,bartholomew kuma who the hell is he\Neither way we don't have time for this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't get out of here we're gonna\Nbe even worse off than we are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's drop hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky Boxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider-neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't need to punch so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The lasers are enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck dodging this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare say you're in\Nfor it. Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow, bone devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That was not my plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, let's be\Nreasonable about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you not kill me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, you know, I\Nam already dead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like that's the size of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This special attack happens! Dumb it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was terrified!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I could pick you enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out! He's down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so explosives work\Non him all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It sank one of them into his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have shorted out\Nsomething inside of him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,His body may be hard as steel,\Nbut his skin still bleeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a normal old human body. It's\Nbeen modified and stuffed full of weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a lock on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ochenta fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Squat Romano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs to fight when we can\Njust make him blow himself up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have thought of this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you might want to sit somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That spot is under a storm warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,From the dark clouds to my slime attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt! Tits out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did it work or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That attack didn't blow him down at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing it did is piss him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperation's the same as\Nadmitting you've lost the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock his ass over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta have a piece of the action, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Diable chambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Flambe shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finally starting to wear him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.44,0:19:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As my vision board!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So many sorrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine lightning strikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're near!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, smash him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one last push!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.76,0:19:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Shanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like it. About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez he looks fine creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's fine then we are\Nscrewed i'm too tired
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to move anymore you know\Nmaybe we should have run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of fighting no\Nit's best to take them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,on as they come one at a\Ntime we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get cornered true\Nbut still he wasn't kuma who
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.56,0:21:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,was he we know he's a cyborg\Nso he must have been a person
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At some point, but if this\Nguy isn't the real Bartholomew
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,kuma then why the heck does he\Nlook just like him maybe the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,guy's got a twin if not they\Nmust have modified the crap
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,out of him to make him look\Nthe same can't imagine why
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,though he couldn't have been\Ncreated from scratch you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,do that with a living person
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,tx4
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.84,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was up for a fight, but that\Nguy was way too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:21:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A break would be nice, but we've\Ngot to find a place to hide first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find us now, there's\Nno way we can fight them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's just sit here for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.34,0:22:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys got some real nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.68,0:22:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? Another enemy? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! Up there! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,House!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.22,0:22:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disgusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an utter disgrace, PX4.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's not made of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Building just one of you pacifistas\Ncosts as much as an entire warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you know how this is going to\Nlook in my report to that lousy Vega Puck?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that another one right with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.22,0:23:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the real one?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it really matter if\Nit's the real one or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already gotten a taste\Nof how strong the fakes are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take another fight, not with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, pacifista?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.34,0:23:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what he called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't seem like much\Nof a pacifist, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you think that's\Nhis name or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, axe boy, just\Nwho the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an identity\Noutside of my axe, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no point in asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no reason to answer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the most well-guarded\Nand tight-lipped man alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can break down my\Nimpenetrable defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can at least tell us your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.48,0:23:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a single\Nthing I just told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.42,0:23:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lips are sealed. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not one person\Nmore secretive than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.44,0:23:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Saint Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Saint Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, to be clear, I\Nwanted you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And not because you wanted to know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.16,0:24:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,PX1, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no problems. This\Nguy shoots beams from
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.84,0:24:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,his hands too starting to\Nlook like they've got a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,whole army of these guys\Nwhat is this crap i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,more concerned staying\Nalive the mystery can wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too worn down there's just no way\Nwe can make it through another fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.04,0:24:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When we haven't even met the admiral yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.60,0:24:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't win, let's run, but not\Nall together, we need to split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.02,0:25:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.76,0:25:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the toughest. We'll\Neach lead our own group.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.66,0:25:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, are you gonna be okay on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.54,0:25:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.92,0:25:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stick together!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.56,0:25:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you no matter what, even\Nif it means sacrificing my life! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.07,0:25:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Red, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're really willing\Nto sacrifice yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you hang back\Nand act as a decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.66,0:25:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ladies-only offer, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take care of your\Nown damn self, Panty Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.90,0:25:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.81,0:25:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let me die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.74,0:25:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect me with all your might, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.02,0:25:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.93,0:25:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already in enough pain as it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fret not, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.10,0:25:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll proudly supply the\Nstrength you currently lack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how much\Nhealing you've left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.78,0:25:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I happened to witness your act\Nof selfless bravery on Thriller
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bark when you offered your\Nown life in place of Luffy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.34,0:25:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there! Head that way! Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No more laser things! Hey! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.98,0:26:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet back on the Sony in three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're splitting into groups!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go after them, Pucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't let\Nhim out of Grove 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.56,0:26:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need that headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.70,0:26:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Smoke Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.16,0:26:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance. Run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are quite dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He took out the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.14,0:26:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.05,0:26:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he apparized?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.10,0:26:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know, but\Nwill you quit pushing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have to go to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.84,0:26:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.02,0:26:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.90,0:26:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd worry about myself if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.56,0:26:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no grudge against you\Npirates, but a job is a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.30,0:26:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.88,0:26:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your offensive skills are impressive,\Nbut they're useless against my defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.02,0:27:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Has she got a good point? Job?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.26,0:27:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.17,0:27:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, this guy is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.40,0:27:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I don't\Neven have Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.86,0:27:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.52,0:27:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is weird. Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.86,0:27:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.77,0:27:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.69,0:27:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you? Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.30,0:27:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get the hell away from Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.06,0:27:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He got hit by one of those laser beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.30,0:27:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.70,0:27:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.58,0:27:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough, Uncle Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kizaru? Hey, Usopp! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.10,0:27:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That man's a Navy Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.90,0:27:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,An Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.82,0:27:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.98,0:28:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time is up, Pirate Hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.66,0:28:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, you had 120 million bounty,\Nso this is not what I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reputation as a swordsman is known\Nfar and wide, but one hit and you're down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.42,0:28:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a real shame, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.74,0:28:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be pretty worn out, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.66,0:28:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.22,0:28:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They have not found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.76,0:28:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll have plenty\Nof time to rest up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.94,0:28:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.14,0:28:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He shoots beams too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to beat these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.52,0:28:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,At point blank like that, he's done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.74,0:28:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:28:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, do something, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.50,0:29:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.22,0:29:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up or else! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.42,0:29:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What the hell? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.18,0:29:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.90,0:29:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stab him! What the?\NWhat can we do? Trying! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.92,0:29:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your foot! I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.28,0:29:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.58,0:29:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Step away from our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.14,0:29:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.22,0:29:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the glint glint fruit\Nand now I'm made of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.70,0:29:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Logia, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.88,0:29:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's made of light?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.44,0:29:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.98,0:29:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.62,0:29:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.53,0:29:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to run away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.08,0:29:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.60,0:30:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.88,0:30:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.79,0:30:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Vantek, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.20,0:30:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome work, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.82,0:30:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He just shifted in place! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cute how your friends want to save\Nyou, But you're far beyond help now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.68,0:30:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.90,0:30:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked some time\Nto come out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.00,0:31:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to do\Nthis, Dark King Rayleigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.50,0:31:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go picking these\Nbuds before they sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.10,0:31:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Their era is only just beginning, and\NI want to see what they do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.26,0:31:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.10,0:31:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The geezer saved Zoro!
